From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Derek Ross <derekross@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 19:29:44 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] nfc: core: don't discover secure elements when the device
 failed to come up

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Derek Ross <derekross@gmail.com>
---
 net/nfc/core.c | 6 ++++--
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/net/nfc/core.c b/net/nfc/core.c
index 56a3cf684..af0325881 100644
--- a/net/nfc/core.c
+++ b/net/nfc/core.c
@@ -117,8 +117,10 @@ int nfc_dev_up(struct nfc_dev *dev)
 	if (dev->ops->dev_up)
 		rc = dev->ops->dev_up(dev);
 
-	if (!rc)
-		dev->dev_up = true;
+	if (rc)
+		goto error;
+
+	dev->dev_up = true;
 
 	/* We have to enable the device before discovering SEs */
 	if (dev->ops->discover_se && dev->ops->discover_se(dev))
